---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="How we work — PageFix" description="See how PageFix moves from business context and product strategy to design, development, testing and practical next steps.">
  <section class="how-hero wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">How it's done / A clear path through the work</span>
    <div class="how-title"><h1>FROM <span>PROBLEM</span><br />TO USEFUL.</h1><p>Good work starts with understanding what needs to change. Then we shape a practical plan, make the right thing, and improve it with real feedback.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="process-section wrap" aria-label="Our four-step process">
    <article>
      <span class="process-number">01</span>
      <div class="process-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="11"/><path d="m28 28 10 10M15 20h10M20 15v10"/></svg></div>
      <div class="process-copy"><small>UNDERSTAND / ALIGN</small><h2>Get clear on the real problem.</h2><p>We start with the business context, the people affected, and what a better outcome would look like. That keeps the work tied to a need instead of jumping straight to screens or tools.</p><ul><li>Goals, audiences and current pain points</li><li>Existing workflows, assets and system constraints</li><li>Priorities, open questions and a shared definition of success</li></ul><div class="process-output"><b>Output</b><span>A focused brief and a practical first scope.</span></div></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="process-number">02</span>
      <div class="process-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M11 35 14 24 31 7a4 4 0 0 1 6 6L20 30l-9 5Z"/><path d="m27 11 7 7M14 24l6 6M9 40h30"/></svg></div>
      <div class="process-copy"><small>DESIGN / SHAPE</small><h2>Make the experience easy to follow.</h2><p>We turn the brief into a structure people can understand. The work may include a brand direction, a user journey, a product interface, or a mix of these.</p><ul><li>Information architecture and key user flows</li><li>Wireframes, prototypes and visual direction</li><li>Responsive patterns and a consistent component system</li></ul><div class="process-output"><b>Output</b><span>A reviewed design direction ready to build.</span></div></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="process-number">03</span>
      <div class="process-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M8 15h13v13H8zM27 8h13v13H27zM27 27h13v13H27zM8 34h13v6H8z"/><path d="M21 21h6M21 34h6M33 21v6"/></svg></div>
      <div class="process-copy"><small>BUILD / CONNECT</small><h2>Build the useful version.</h2><p>We develop the responsive experience and connect the pieces it depends on. Reviews happen along the way, so important details can be adjusted before launch.</p><ul><li>Frontend and backend implementation</li><li>Content, forms, APIs and business-system connections</li><li>Checks across key screen sizes and core user journeys</li></ul><div class="process-output"><b>Output</b><span>A working product or system, ready to share.</span></div></div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="process-number">04</span>
      <div class="process-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M9 35 21 23l7 7 13-15"/><path d="M29 15h12v12M8 41h32"/><circle cx="14" cy="30" r="2"/><circle cx="28" cy="30" r="2"/></svg></div>
      <div class="process-copy"><small>LAUNCH / LEARN</small><h2>Use feedback to choose what comes next.</h2><p>Shipping is a beginning, not a finish line. We review what people find useful, surface friction, and identify the next improvements worth making.</p><ul><li>Prepare the handoff and launch checklist</li><li>Review feedback from real use</li><li>Prioritize the next round around evidence and impact</li></ul><div class="process-output"><b>Output</b><span>A clear next step instead of a guess at what to improve.</span></div></div>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section class="capabilities wrap"><div class="capability-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Capabilities</span><h2>Bring the right pieces<br />together for the job.</h2><p>We can support one focused need or connect several disciplines around the same business goal.</p></div><div class="capability-list">
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 19 10 5l4 9 2-5 4 10M3 21h18"/></svg>Brand positioning</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 13h5M8 17h8"/></svg>UI / UX design</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 8h18M7 6h.01M10 6h.01M7 12h10M7 16h6"/></svg>Website development</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v14H4zM8 9h8M8 13h5M8 17h8"/></svg>Product design</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M4.6 4.6l2.1 2.1M17.3 17.3l2.1 2.1M3 12h3M18 12h3M4.6 19.4l2.1-2.1M17.3 6.7l2.1-2.1"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/></svg>AI assistants</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="7" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="6" rx="1"/><path d="M10 7h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5M14 17h-3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1"/></svg>Workflow automation</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5v7c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3 1.5 0 2.8-.2 4-.5M4 12v7c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3"/><path d="m17 13 4 4-4 4M21 17h-6"/></svg>CRM integration</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 19V5M4 19h17M8 15l4-4 3 2 5-6"/><path d="M17 7h3v3"/></svg>Lead management</span>
  </div></section>
  <section class="how-cta wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Start with the challenge</span><h2>We’ll help you find<br />the <span>useful next step.</span></h2><a class="button primary" href="/start-a-project">Start a project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</Layout>
